/tv/66115/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1394645","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"小学生のシュンとユウタは、失くしたドローンを探して下水道を探検中、奇獣に出くわしてしまう。調査で町にいた番場は、襲われる二人を発見し脱出を試みるが…。製薬会社のエージェント・木村に救われる番場たち、彼らの目的とは…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8pmN75zw0bW8M5vOdP4Nqgoj8cS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8pmN75zw0bW8M5vOdP4Nqgoj8cS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1394646","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"深夜のコンビニ。店員のレンは、先輩サイトウにこき使われる怠惰な日々を送っていた。しかし、突然店内にこだまする悲鳴により日常が一変する。レンとサイトウ、偶然居合わせた女子高生アユミを襲ったものとは…？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p6IYjCQKNrATgUzuVQEqf63sbb1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p6IYjCQKNrATgUzuVQEqf63sbb1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1394647","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場は奇獣調査のため、観光船に乗り南極を訪れていた。そんな中、深海にいた潜水艇に事故が発生。番場は乗客のヨウスケとチアキの救出に協力するが、深海に潜む魔物を目撃することに…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/69HJTbEe0KLwyWLP8aayPMLRKuh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/69HJTbEe0KLwyWLP8aayPMLRKuh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1394648","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"田舎のとある小学校。放課後、カズトとミノリは残って遊んでいた。教師ハルコが見咎め、二人を下校させるつもりだったが…。地震と共にグラウンドに突如現れたのは…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8z8xX3PRXOYE4Sqb1fdErGSQctC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8z8xX3PRXOYE4Sqb1fdErGSQctC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1394649","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"かつての恋人サオリと奇獣の調査に向かう番場。しかし道中、トンネルの崩落事故に巻き込まれてしまう。姿の見えないサオリ、生存者を襲う謎の生物、果たして番場は…!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hUVpDrcjAEaMEi2mNpVW3B9Ll4q.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hUVpDrcjAEaMEi2mNpVW3B9Ll4q.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1394650","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場は、とある植物園で起こった事件の事情聴取に同席していた。唯一の生存者が淡々と話す不可解な経緯。番場は自らが追う奇獣が関係していることを直感する…！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lBEU2MpfQg9jGfiKJGUEpB9X2q0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBEU2MpfQg9jGfiKJGUEpB9X2q0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/66115/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1394651","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"番場は老婆から古い体験談を聞いていた。とある漁村に突如現れた奇獣・影鰐。村に犠牲者が出たことから村長は漁に出ることを禁ずる。しかし漁師の町蔵は娘の薬代のため、たった一人で禁じられた漁に出ようとするが…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kFbvUESDn0a2Hnm1tCgMaSRzKLa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kFbvUESDn0a2Hnm1tCgMaSRzKLa.jpg","language":"xx"}],